{
 "about": "The Windows (AMD proprietary driver, LLPC) RDNA4 network. Differs from linux/: NR_QUANT_EXPLICIT=1 and NR_QPAD=0 on every pipeline, fswin_t pipelines fully unrolled in the source (windows/build/unroll_glsl.py). windows/build/build_network.py rdna4 builds it. Per pipeline for LLPC's register allocation: NR_EXPAND_GROUP=2 where it lowers VGPRs and was faster on Windows (round 9), activation fragments read as dwords (act_v4); all verified byte-identical frames on RADV. Not taken from linux/ (measured on Windows, round 17): attn NR_ATTN_REMAP=16 (the C=512 projection after it ran 0.15 -> 0.42 ms at 1080p), gemmprojw NR_OCC_LDS (4K 0.74 -> 2.02 ms), gemmprojc (host: NR_PROJC=1).",
